; OpenSPM-authored import list for the freestanding player-local module.
;   llvm-dlltool -m i386:x86-64 -d m14_freestanding_kernel32.def -l kernel32.lib
; Names only (documented kernel32.dll export names); no Windows SDK content.
; Must list exactly the kernel32 calls declared in m14_freestanding_crt.h.
LIBRARY kernel32.dll
EXPORTS
AddVectoredExceptionHandler
CloseHandle
CreateEventW
CreateThread
GetCurrentThreadId
GetEnvironmentVariableA
GetModuleHandleA
GetModuleHandleExW
GetProcAddress
RemoveVectoredExceptionHandler
SetEvent
Sleep
VirtualQuery
WaitForSingleObject
